Package: flame
Title: Functional and Literature Analysis of Multi-omics Enrichment
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Evangelos", "Karatzas", email = "karatzas@fleming.gr", role = "aut"),
    person("Fotis A.", "Baltoumas", email = "baltoumas@fleming.gr", role = "aut"),
    person("Georgios A.", "Pavlopoulos", email = "pavlopoulos@fleming.gr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: A web platform for functional and literature enrichment analysis
    of multiple gene lists. Runs and combines g:Profiler, STRING, Enrichr,
    WebGestalt, PANTHER, GeneCodis, clusterProfiler (MSigDB; ORA and GSEA with
    fgsea) and custom GMT gene sets, annotates variants and GWAS results with
    Ensembl VEP, compares runs with
    Fisher's combined probability test, and serves a REST API (plumber) and a
    TypeScript web client with interactive tables, plots and networks.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/pavlopouloslab/flame
BugReports: https://github.com/pavlopouloslab/flame/issues
